It's KETO ice cream time again, this time it is Keto Orange Chocolate Chip and it's freaking delicious. A refreshing change from chocolate ice cream with orange flavour too
Super easy to make, cold process so no heating (unless you want to use a heat activated ice cream stabilizer). 
Full recipe is in the video as requested. 



